# Blood Bikes Wales — UI Guidelines

Plasma Controller is a tool for Blood Bikes Wales controllers. Follow these guidelines for all UI work. Full document: `docs/brand-guidelines.md`.

## Brand principles

- **Dependable**: stable colours, clear layouts, plain language
- **Urgent, not alarming**: crimson for identity/actions; avoid visual panic or excessive red
- **Operationally clear**: every screen makes the next action obvious
- **Volunteer-friendly**: broad age range, outdoor use, varying digital confidence
- **Accessible by default**: high contrast, large tap targets, visible labels

Voice: professional, trustworthy, urgent, approachable. Short imperative labels (`Confirm Collection`, `Report Issue`). No jargon in critical flows.

## Design tokens

Use Tailwind classes from `@theme` in `app/app.css` (prefix `bb-*`). Never hardcode hex in components.

| Token | Class examples | Hex | Use |
|-------|----------------|-----|-----|
| Primary | `bg-bb-primary` | #ED2F45 | Brand colour, headers, active nav |
| Primary dark | `bg-bb-primary-dark` | #991B1B | Hover/pressed primary |
| Primary light | `bg-bb-primary-light` | #FEE2E2 | Selected states, tags |
| CTA / splash | `bg-bb-cta` | #B91C1C | Primary buttons, splash, tab active |
| Navy | `bg-bb-navy`, `text-bb-navy` | #1E3A5F | Structure, area badges, headings |
| Navy light | `bg-bb-navy-light` | #2D5F8A | Profile cards, secondary accents |
| Success | `text-bb-success` | #059669 | Delivered, sync confirmed |
| Success light | `bg-bb-success-light` | #D1FAE5 | Success badge/card bg |
| Warning | `text-bb-warning` | #D97706 | Offline banner, escalation |
| Warning light | `bg-bb-warning-light` | #FEF3C7 | Warning backgrounds |
| Error | `text-bb-error` | #DC2626 | Validation, failed actions |
| Error light | `bg-bb-error-light` | #FEE2E2 | Error backgrounds |
| Gray 50 | `bg-bb-gray-50` | #F9FAFB | Screen backgrounds |
| Gray 100 | `border-bb-gray-100` | #F3F4F6 | Dividers, header borders |
| Gray 200 | `border-bb-gray-200` | #E5E7EB | Borders |
| Gray 300 | `border-bb-gray-300` | #D1D5DB | Input/disabled borders |
| Gray 500 | `text-bb-gray-500` | #6B7280 | Secondary text, placeholders |
| Gray 700 | `text-bb-gray-700` | #374151 | Labels, outline button text |
| Gray 900 | `text-bb-gray-900` | #111827 | Primary text, headings |
| White | `bg-bb-white` | #FFFFFF | Cards, headers, footers |

**Colour rules**: one crimson CTA per critical screen; navy for trust/structure; semantic colours only for their meaning; never colour-only status (always icon + label); no decorative gradients in operational UI.

## Typography

Font stack (set in `app/app.css`): Rubik, Poppins, Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui.

| Role | Size | Weight | Colour |
|------|------|--------|--------|
| Screen title | 28px | 800 | gray-900 |
| Section heading | 17–24px | 700–800 | gray-900 |
| Body | 15–16px | 500–600 | gray-900 |
| Labels/captions | 13–14px | 500 | gray-500 |
| Primary button | 17–18px | 700 | white on bb-cta |
| Outline button | 17px | 600 | gray-700 |
| Job IDs | mono | 500 | gray-900 |

## Layout and components

**Screen structure**: Gray 50 bg → white NavHeader (gray-100 bottom border, px-5) → scrollable card content (px-5) → white ScreenFooter (gray-100 top border, px-5).

**Cards**: white bg, 16px radius, 20px padding, no border (float on gray-50). Row dividers: 1px gray-100.

**Buttons**: height 56px, radius 12px. Primary: `bg-bb-cta text-white font-bold`. Outline: white bg, 1.5px gray-300 border, gray-700 text. Pressed: opacity 0.75. Disabled: opacity 0.45–0.85.

**Spacing**: screen/footer horizontal 20px; card padding 16–24px; gaps 8/12/16/20px.

**Status badges**:

| Status | Background | Text | Border |
|--------|------------|------|--------|
| Active | #DBEAFE | #1D4ED8 | #93C5FD |
| Pending | white | #374151 | #6EE7B7 |
| Success | success-light | success | none |
| Error | error-light | error | none |

**Offline banner**: warning-light bg, `#FCD34D` border, warning text. Copy: "Offline. Your updates will sync automatically when a connection is available."

## Icons

**Logo**: use `/brand/logo.png` (`public/brand/logo.png`). Alt text: `Blood Bikes Wales`. Do not recreate or distort the circular mark.

Use **lucide-react** (outline, strokeWidth 1.5–2). Active tab/action: bb-cta; informational: gray-500; success: success green. Success state icon: CheckCircle 72px in success green.

## Dark mode

Operational flows (dispatch, collection, delivery) are **light mode only**. Do not add `dark:` variants to job/delivery screens. Dark mode is optional only for settings/profile/informational pages.

## Accessibility (non-negotiable)

- Gray 900 on white/gray-50 for main reading content
- Visible focus states for keyboard users
- Visible input labels (not placeholder-only)
- Minimum touch target 44×44px on mobile
- Status/urgency/completion/errors: colour + text label + icon

## Do / don't

**Do**: use `bb-*` theme tokens; one primary footer action on critical workflows; cards for grouped job/collection/delivery content; show offline banner at top before submission.

**Don't**: introduce colours outside the palette; use Inter-only without Rubik/Poppins in the stack; rely on colour alone for status; use gradients in operational UI; use casual language in critical flows.

## shadcn/ui

Use shadcn components from `~/components/ui`. Add new ones with `npx shadcn@latest add [component]`.

- Prefer shadcn primitives over custom components (`Button`, `Card`, `Input`, `Badge`, etc.)
- shadcn semantic tokens in `:root` (`primary`, `destructive`, `background`, etc.) are mapped to Blood Bikes Wales colours in `app/app.css`
- Primary CTAs: `<Button>` uses `bg-primary` → brand crimson `#B91C1C`; extend with `className="h-14 rounded-bb-button text-lg font-bold"` for 56px operational buttons
- Destructive actions: `<Button variant="destructive">` maps to `#DC2626`
- Use `cn()` from `~/lib/utils` to merge Tailwind classes
- Icons: `lucide-react` (already configured in `components.json`)
